solution.p:
Using the constant and quotient rules,

   \lim\limits_{x\to }\left(\frac{3f(x)}{g(x)}\right)\amp =
         \frac{\lim\limits_{x\to }(3f(x))}{\lim\limits_{x\to }g(x)}
   \amp = \frac{3\lim\limits_{x\to }f(x)}{\lim\limits_{x\to }g(x)} 
    \amp \frac{3(6)}{3} = 6 
.

