li.p:
We compute this directly using .

  \fp(1)\amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{f(1+h)-f(1)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3(1+h)^2+5(1+h)-7 - (3(1)^2+5(1)-7)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3(1+2h+h^2)+5+5h-7 - 1}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3+6h+3h^2+5+5h-8}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3h^2+11h}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} (3h+11)
  \amp = 11
.

Again, using the definition,

  \fp(3)\amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{f(3+h)-f(3)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3(3+h)^2+5(3+h)-7 - (3(3)^2+5(3)-7)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3(9+6h+h^2)+15+3h-7 - 35}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{27+18h+3h^2+15+3h-42}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{3h^2+23h}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} 3h+23
  \amp = 23
.

