li.p:
This is the same as the first answer, since

  2\sqrt{1-x^2} -\frac{2x^2}{\sqrt{1-x^2}} \amp = \frac{2(1-x^2)-2x^2}{\sqrt{1-x^2}}
   \amp =\frac{2(1-2x^2)}{\sqrt{1-x^2}}
.

