solution.p:
Implicitly differentiate both sides of
C = 2\pi r with respect to t:

  C \amp = 2\pi r
  \lzoo{t}{C} \amp = \lzoo{t}{2\pi r}
  \lz{C}{t} \amp =2\pi \lz{r}{t}
.

