solution.p:
Simpson's Rule states that

  \int_0^1e^{-x^2}\, dx \approx \frac{0.25}{3}\Big[1+4(0.939)+2(0.779)+4(0.570) + 0.368\Big] = 0.7468\overline{3}
.

