solution.p:
We start by rewriting the integrand so that it looks like
\sqrt{x^2-a^2} for some value of a:

  \sqrt{4x^2-1} \amp = \sqrt{4\left(x^2-\frac14\right)}
  \amp = 2\sqrt{x^2-\left(\frac12\right)^2}
.

