solution.p:
This is a Riemann sum.
Taking the limit as the subinterval length goes to 0 gives

  W   \amp =  \int_0^{30} 6240\pi(35-y)\, dy
  \amp =  6240\pi\left(35y-1/2y^2\right)\Big|_0^{30}
  \amp =   11,762,123 \,\text{ft--lb}
  \amp \approx  1.176 \times 10^7 \,\text{ft--lb} 
.

