solution.p:
Solving for \yp, we have

  \yp = \frac{2x}{C-2y}
.

From the solution,
we know that \displaystyle C = \frac{x^2+y^2}{y}.
Then

  \yp \amp = \frac{2x}{\displaystyle \frac{x^2+y^2}{y} - 2y}
  \amp =\frac{2xy}{x^2+y^2-2y^2}
  \amp = \frac{2xy}{x^2-y^2}
.

