statement.p:
In the plane,
the equation x=2 defines a ;
in space, x=2 defines a .

solution.p:
Yes, as opposite sides have equal length.
\norm{\overline{AB}} = \sqrt{21}=\norm{\overline{CD}};
\norm{\overline{BC}} = \sqrt{6}=\norm{\overline{AD}}.

