solution.p:

  \norm{\vec u} \amp = \sqrt{\sin^2(\theta) \cos^2(\varphi) +\sin^2(\theta) \sin^2(\varphi) +\cos^2(\theta) }
  \amp = \sqrt{\sin^2(\theta) (\cos^2(\varphi) +\sin^2(\varphi) )+\cos^2(\theta) }
  \amp = \sqrt{\sin^2(\theta) +\cos^2(\theta) }
  \amp =1
.

