section.p:
We can use the properties of the dot product found in to rearrange the formula found in :
\proj uv \amp =  rac{\dotp uv}{\dotp vv}\vec v \amp =  rac{\dotp uv}{
orm{\vec v}^2}\vec v \amp = \left(\vec u \cdot  rac{\vec v}{
orm{\vec v}}ight)  rac{\vec v}{
orm{\vec v}} .

