li.p:
The symmetric equations of the line are

  \frac{x-x_0}{a} = \frac{y-y_0}{b}=\frac{z-z_0}{c}
.

the symmetric equations of the line are

  \frac{x-2}{-1}=\frac{y-3}{1} = \frac{z-1}{2}
.

