solution.p:
The distance h from Q to the plane is given by :

  h \amp = \frac{\abs{\vec n\cdot \overrightarrow{PQ}}}{\vnorm n}
  \amp = \frac{\abs{\la 2,-5,6\ra \cdot \la 2,1,2.5\ra}}{\norm{\la 2,-5,6\ra}}
  \amp = \frac{ \abs{14}}{\sqrt{65}}
  \amp \approx 1.74
.

