solution.p:
This is not a unit vector; to find \unitnormal(t),
we need to divide \unittangentprime(t) by its magnitude.

  \norm{\unittangentprime(t)} \amp = \sqrt{\frac{16(2t+1)^2}{(8t^2+2)^3}+\frac{16(1-2t)^2}{(8t^2+2)^3}}
  \amp = \sqrt{\frac{16(8t^2+2)}{(8t^2+2)^3}}
  \amp = \frac{4}{8t^2+2}
.

