statement.p:
Moreover,

  a_\text{T}  \amp = \vat\cdot\unittangent(t) = \frac{d}{dt}\Big(\norm{\vec v(t)}\Big)
  a_\text{N}  \amp = \vat\cdot \unitnormal(t) = \sqrt{\norm{\vec a(t)}^2-a_\text{T} ^2} = \frac{\norm{\vat\times\vvt}}{\norm{\vvt}} = \norm{\vvt}\,\norm{\unittangentprime(t)}

