subsection.p:
The Chain Rule states that

  \frac{d\vec r}{dt} \amp = \frac{d\vec r}{ds}\cdot\frac{ds}{dt}
  \vrp(t) \amp = \vrp(s)\cdot \norm{\vrp(t)}
.

