subsection.p:
If \vec r(s) is parametrized by the arc length parameter, then

  \unittangent(s) = \frac{\vrp(s)}{\norm{\vrp(s)}}  \text{ and }  \unitnormal(s) = \frac{\unittangentprime(s)}{\norm{\unittangentprime(s)}}
.

solution.p:
We compute \kappa using the second part of .

  \kappa \amp = \frac{\abs{(-r\sin(t) )(-r\sin(t) ) - (-r\cos(t) )(r\cos(t) )}}{\big( (-r\sin(t) )^2+(r\cos(t) )^2\big)^{3/2}}
  \amp = \frac{r^2(\sin^2(t) +\cos^2(t) )}{\big(r^2(\sin^2(t) +\cos^2(t) )\big)^{3/2}}
  \amp = \frac{r^2}{r^3} = \frac1r
.

