solution.p:
Thus

  \kappa(t) \amp = \frac{\norm{\vrp(t)\times\vrp'(t)}}{\norm{\vrp(t)}^3}
  \amp = \frac{\norm{\la 12t^2,-12t,2\ra}}{\norm{\la 1,2t,6t^2\ra}^3}
  \amp = \frac{\sqrt{144t^4+144t^2+4}}{\left(\sqrt{1+4t^2+36t^4\ }\right)^3}

