solution.p:
Using , we have:

  f_x(x,y) \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{f(x+h,y) - f(x,y)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{(x+h)^2y+2(x+h)+y^3 - (x^2y+2x+y^3)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{x^2y+2xhy+h^2y+2x+2h+y^3-(x^2y+2x+y^3)}{h}
  \amp = \lim_{h\to 0} \frac{2xhy+h^2y+2h}{h}
  \amp =\lim_{h\to 0} 2xy+hy+2
  \amp = 2xy+2
.

