solution.p:
Following , we find

  f_x(x,y) = 2xy+1,\qquad f_y(x,y) = x^2,\qquad \frac{dx}{dt} = \cos(t) ,\qquad \frac{dy}{dt}= 5e^{5t}
.

Applying the theorem, we have

  \frac{dz}{dt} = (2xy+1)\cos(t) + 5x^2e^{5t}
.

