solution.p:
Thus
\ds \frac{\partial z}{\partial s} = (2xy+1)(2s) + (x^2)(2) = 4xys+2s + 2x^2, \text{ and }
\ds \frac{\partial z}{\partial t} = (2xy+1)(3) + (x^2)(-1) = 6xy-x^2+3 .

