solution.p:
We start by computing the partial derivatives of f:

  f_x(x,y) = \frac{-x}{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\qquad \text{ and } \qquad f_y(x,y) = \frac{-y}{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}
.

