statement.p:
\ds f(x,y) = \sin(x) \cos(y);
R is bounded by x=0, x=\pi,
y=-\pi/2 and y=\pi/2.

\ds f(x,y) =x^2y-xy^2;
R is bounded by y=x,
y=1 and x=3.

