section.p:
Summing up all n of the approximations to the surface area gives

  \text{surface area over \(R\)}  \approx \sum_{i=1}^m\sum_{j=1}^n \sqrt{1+f_x(x_i,y_j)^2+f_y(x_i,y_j)^2}\Delta A_{ij}
.

