solution.p:
Cylinders (tubes) centered at the origin,
parallel to the z-axis;
planes parallel to the z-axis that intersect the z-axis;
planes parallel to the xy-plane.

Spheres centered at the origin;
planes parallel to the z-axis that intersect the z-axis;
cones centered on the z-axis with point at the origin.

