statement.p:
Under reasonable conditions,
if \curl \vec F = \vec 0,
what can we conclude about the vector field \vec F?

\vec F = \langle y,x\rangle;
C is the top half of the unit circle,
beginning at (1,0) and ending at (-1,0).

