statement.p:
Let \vec F = \la x-y,x+y\ra,
let C be the circle of radius 2 centered at the origin and define R to be the interior of that circle,
as shown in .
Verify the Divergence Theorem;
that is, find the flux across C and show it is equal to the double integral of \divv \vec F over R.

