statement.p:
In the plane,
flux is a measurement of how much of the vector field passes across a ;
in space, flux is a measurement of how much of the vector field passes across a .

\surfaceS is the plane z = 3x+y on
0\leq x\leq 1, 1\leq y\leq 4;
\vec F = \langle x^2,-z,2y\rangle.

