//draw((2.3,2.5,0.2)--(1.55,2.25,2.5),Arrow3(size=2mm));

answer.p:
Circulation on C: The flow along the line from (0,0,2) to (4,0,0) is 0;
from (4,0,0) to (0,3,0) it is -6,
and from (0,3,0) to (0,0,2) it is 6.
The total circulation is 0+(-6)+6=0.

