statement.p:
C is the curve whose x- and y-values are given by
\vec r(t) = \langle 2\cos(t),2\sin(t)\rangle and the z-values are determined by the function z=x^2+y^3-3y+1;
\vec F = \langle -y,x,z\rangle.

