statement.p:
C is the curve whose x- and y-values are given by
\vec r(t) = \langle \cos(t),3\sin(t)\rangle and the z-values are determined by the function z=5-2x-y;
\vec F = \langle -\frac13y,3x,\frac23y-3x\rangle.

